@model IEnumerable<Lead> @{ViewData["Title"]="Leads";}<div class="toolbar"><form method="get"><input class="input" name="q" placeholder="Search lead/company" value="@Context.Request.Query["q"]"><button class="btn secondary">Search</button></form><a class="btn" href="/Leads/Create">+ Lead</a></div><div class="panel table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Lead</th><th>Company</th><th>Source</th><th>Status</th><th>Priority</th><th>Value</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>@foreach(var l in Model){<tr><td><strong>@l.LeadName</strong><br>@l.Email</td><td>@l.CompanyName</td><td>@l.Source</td><td><span class="badge">@l.Status</span></td><td>@l.Priority</td><td>₹@l.ExpectedValue.ToString("N0")</td><td><a class="btn secondary" href="/Leads/Edit/@l.Id">Edit</a> @if(l.Status==LeadStatus.Qualified){<form style="display:inline" method="post" action="/Leads/Convert"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="@l.Id"><button class="btn" data-confirm="Convert this qualified lead into a customer and opportunity?">Convert</button></form>}</td></tr>}</tbody></table></div>